  "title": "BrightNest Cleaning Co. – 90-Day Local Marketing Launch Sprint",
  "content": "## Plan Overview\n\nThis plan executes a comprehensive local marketing launch for BrightNest Cleaning Co. in Charlotte, NC, targeting 10 recurring customers in 90 days across 5 channels: GBP/Local SEO, Nextdoor, Flyers, Referral Program, and Direct Outreach. The approach is:\n\n1. **Research Phase (parallel):** Gather competitive intelligence on Charlotte cleaning companies' GBP profiles and local SEO, plus research Nextdoor best practices and build the outreach target list.\n2. **Asset Creation Phase (parallel after research):** Build out optimized GBP content/posting calendar, design flyer/doorhanger + drop plan, create referral offer program, and draft Nextdoor setup/content plan.\n3. **Synthesis:** Compile everything into a unified 90-day sprint playbook with weekly milestones, budget allocation, and KPI tracking.\n\nUncertainty is low (clear business, area, budget, goal), so we parallelize aggressively with join='all'.",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "goal": "Research Charlotte cleaning market competitive landscape: analyze top 5 competitors' GBP profiles (services listed, review counts, posting frequency, categories, photos), their local SEO keywords ranking for 'house cleaning Charlotte', 'Airbnb turnover cleaning Charlotte NC', 'maid service South End Charlotte', etc. Also research current GBP optimization best practices (service categories, attributes, posting cadence, review generation tactics). Deliver a competitive analysis + GBP optimization checklist specific to BrightNest.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Research Nextdoor marketing best practices for local service businesses (especially cleaning companies): what post types get traction (recommendations, offers, neighborhood tips), optimal posting frequency, how to set up a Business Page, how to use Local Deals, and any Charlotte-specific Nextdoor groups or neighborhood dynamics for South End, Dilworth, Plaza Midwood, Myers Park, NoDa, Matthews. Deliver a Nextdoor setup guide + 30-day content calendar with 12 specific post ideas.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Build a comprehensive outreach target list for BrightNest Cleaning Co. in Charlotte, NC. Research and compile: (1) Realtors - top-producing residential agents in South End, Dilworth, Plaza Midwood, Myers Park, NoDa, Matthews (names, brokerages, contact info/emails where available), (2) Property management companies serving Charlotte rentals in those neighborhoods, (3) Airbnb/short-term rental hosts and management companies active in Charlotte (search Airbnb listings in target neighborhoods to identify hosts/companies, search for STR management companies). Target 15-20 realtors, 10 property managers, and 10-15 Airbnb hosts/companies. Include a suggested outreach email/script template for each segment.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Create the complete GBP optimization plan and local SEO execution guide for BrightNest Cleaning Co. using the competitive research. Include: (1) Optimized business description with target keywords, (2) Complete services list with descriptions and pricing hints, (3) Category selections (primary + secondary), (4) Photo strategy (types needed, quantity, naming conventions), (5) Google Posts content calendar for 90 days (weekly posts with specific topics/CTAs), (6) Review generation system (ask scripts, QR code strategy, timing), (7) Q&A section pre-population, (8) Citation/NAP consistency checklist for top 15 local directories. Make everything copy-paste ready.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": [0]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Design a complete flyer/doorhanger strategy and drop plan for BrightNest Cleaning Co. in Charlotte with $600 print budget. Include: (1) Flyer copy and layout specification for both residential cleaning and Airbnb turnover services (front/back content, headline, offer, CTA, QR code tracking), (2) Doorhanger variant copy, (3) Print specs and vendor recommendations (VistaPrint, PrintingForLess, local Charlotte printers) with cost breakdown for $600, (4) Neighborhood drop plan with specific streets/complexes in South End, Dilworth, Plaza Midwood, Myers Park, NoDa, Matthews prioritized by density of target customers, (5) EDDM route selection for $300 budget (carrier routes, expected household counts), (6) Drop schedule across 90 days (which neighborhoods which weeks), (7) Tracking mechanism (unique URLs, phone numbers, or promo codes per drop zone). Generate the actual flyer copy ready for a designer.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": [0]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Design the complete referral program for BrightNest Cleaning Co. Include: (1) Referral offer structure (what the referrer gets, what the new customer gets - consider $25-50 credit, free add-on service, percentage off), (2) Program mechanics (how to refer, tracking method, redemption process), (3) Referral card design specs and copy, (4) Email/SMS templates to announce the program to existing customers, (5) Social media announcement posts, (6) Integration with the flyer campaign (referral code on flyers), (7) Partner referral tier for realtors/property managers (higher incentive structure), (8) 90-day referral campaign timeline with touchpoints, (9) Budget allocation from the $300 misc budget. Make all copy and templates ready to use.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
